 "remarks": "Welcome to Apartment 9K at 80 County Street in Norwalk! This inviting second-floor apartment offers the perfect balance of privacy, convenience, and tranquility. With a serene setting that gives you a quiet escape from the noise of everyday life. Inside, you'll find a bright, welcoming layout with a functional kitchen, a comfortable bedroom and bath, and plenty of space to make your own. Located in the wolfpit area of Norwalk, you're close to shopping, dining, and parks, with easy access to I-95, the Merritt Parkway, and Metro-North for a smooth commute to NYC and beyond. If you're simply looking for a comfortable and quiet place to call home in one of the most convenient cities in fairfield county, Unit 9K is ready for you. Schedule your showing today!",
